  occluder: solid rectangle of occluder_color covering exactly one full slot-row or slot-column
    axis: horizontal (full row) or vertical (full column)
    hidden_slot_idx: any of the k slot positions (0 to k-1)
    hidden_row_or_col_in_sprite: must have >=1 filled cell (otherwise nothing to reconstruct)
  visible_copies: all identical to the sprite mask; >=1 must be fully visible (not overlapped by occluder)
  output:
